
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Advanced SOAR | Security Operations Center</title>
<style>
:root {
  color-scheme: dark;
  --bg: #0b1220;
  --card: #18253a;
  --border: #30425c;
  --text: #f1f5fb;
  --muted: #a8b8ce;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}
header {
  padding: 30px 20px;
  background: #111d31;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
main {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 20px;
}
h1 { font-size: 27px; margin: 10px 0; }
h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; }
p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #163e36;
  color: #7de5b1;
  padding: 7px 12px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 12px;
}
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.card {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.grid .card { margin-bottom: 0; }
.metric {
  font-size: 36px;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-top: 10px;
}
.label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
.red { color: #ff7785; }
.yellow { color: #ffd166; }
.green { color: #72e3ac; }
.blue { color: #83b6ff; }
.threat { margin: 20px 0; }
.threat-top {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-size: 14px;
}
.track {
  background: #30415c;
  height: 12px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.bar { height: 100%; border-radius: 10px; }
.alert {
  padding: 15px;
  border-left: 4px solid #ff7785;
  background: #202c42;
  margin-top: 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
}
.alert strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.alert p { margin: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; }
table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 13px;
}
th, td {
  padding: 12px 8px;
  text-align: left;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
th { color: var(--muted); }
.table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
footer {
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 12px;
}
@media (min-width: 700px) {
  .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <span class="tag">SIMULATED SECURITY LAB</span>
  <h1>🛡️ Security Operations Center</h1>
  <p>Advanced Threat Detection & SOAR Automation</p>
  <p>Cybersecurity Engineering Portfolio | David Jeffries</p>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="label">TOTAL EVENTS</div>
      <div class="metric blue">18</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="label">DETECTED INCIDENTS</div>
      <div class="metric yellow">2</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="label">CORRELATED FINDINGS</div>
      <div class="metric red">3</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="label">AUTOMATED TESTS</div>
      <div class="metric green">5/5</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Threat Risk Analysis</h2>

    <div class="threat">
      <div class="threat-top">
        <span>Brute Force + Successful Login</span>
        <strong class="red">95 / 100</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="track">
        <div class="bar" style="width:95%;background:#ff7785"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="threat">
      <div class="threat-top">
        <span>Password Spraying</span>
        <strong class="yellow">85 / 100</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="track">
        <div class="bar" style="width:85%;background:#ffd166"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="threat">
      <div class="threat-top">
        <span>Brute Force</span>
        <strong class="blue">75 / 100</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="track">
        <div class="bar" style="width:75%;background:#83b6ff"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Threat Detection Alerts</h2>

    <div class="alert">
      <strong class="red">CRITICAL — Brute Force With Success</strong>
      <p>Risk Score: 95</p>
      <p>MITRE ATT&CK: T1110, T1078</p>
      <p>Action: Investigate successful authentication,
      review account activity, and consider credential reset.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="alert">
      <strong class="yellow">HIGH — Password Spraying</strong>
      <p>Source IP: 203.0.113.77</p>
      <p>Targeted Accounts: 5</p>
      <p>MITRE ATT&CK: T1110.003</p>
      <p>Action: Review authentication logs,
      strengthen MFA, and assess source-IP restrictions.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="alert">
      <strong class="yellow">HIGH — Brute Force</strong>
      <p>Risk Score: 75</p>
      <p>MITRE ATT&CK: T1110</p>
      <p>Action: Investigate repeated login failures
      and review account lockout policies.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>SOAR Incident Response</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Threat</th>
            <th>Severity</th>
            <th>Response</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Brute Force + Success</td>
            <td class="red">Critical</td>
            <td>Escalate for review</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Brute Force</td>
            <td class="yellow">High</td>
            <td>Investigate account</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Password Spraying</td>
            <td class="yellow">High</td>
            <td>Review targeted accounts</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>All containment actions require human approval.
    No real accounts or networks are modified.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Engineering Capabilities</h2>
    <p>Python-based detection and correlation</p>
    <p>Automated incident response playbooks</p>
    <p>MITRE ATT&CK threat classification</p>
    <p>GitHub Actions CI/CD automation</p>
    <p>Five passing automated security tests</p>
    <p>JSON incident and correlation reporting</p>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  Advanced SOAR Cybersecurity Portfolio
  | David Jeffries | Demonstration Data
</footer>

</body>
</html>
